  "next_id": 58,
  "notes": [
    {
      "at": [
        -40,
        -40
      ],
      "id": 57,
      "text": "Automation sensors (SN-229) on 24 V, no microcontroller: drag the PNP sensor's target closer than 4 mm and its lamp\nlights; the NPN sensor switches a 24 V relay (with its flyback diode): the NO contact\nlights the second lamp, the NC contact the third one while no target is near. The 4-20 mA transmitter into 250 ohm\ngives 1-5 V on the voltmeter (drag it). Hold the mouse on the PIR: the IRLZ44N sounds the 12 V buzzer for 3 s after the movement."
    }
  ],
